{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:00 2026-09-27 HKT</p>\n\n<p>2004年港姐亞軍朱慧敏自2021年與心臟科醫生陳良貴結婚後，4年抱兩，先後誕下3歲大女Shera及1歲半的細仔Aten，湊成一個「好」字。一家四口近日趁著中秋佳節，齊齊到維多利亞公園賞花燈。朱慧敏更在社交平台感性發文，分享與子女的溫馨互動，字裡行間充滿母愛，場面溫馨滿瀉。</p>\n<h2>朱慧敏餅印兒子遺傳優良基因</h2>\n<p>從朱慧敏分享的影片可見，一對仔女的可愛中秋造型瞬間成為全場焦點。大女Shera穿上一襲粉紅色的漢服，配上精緻的刺繡花紋和腰帶，頭上還夾著流蘇髮飾，活脫脫是個古典小美人；而弟弟Aten亦不輸蝕，身穿米白色系的唐裝衫褲套裝，樣子精靈可愛，萌態十足，兒子遺傳了朱慧敏的優良基因，外貌甚似媽咪。兩姐弟在公園裡奔跑嬉戲，朱慧敏與老公則全程流露寵愛眼神，陳良貴更一度將大女「騎膊馬」，讓她近距離觸摸花燈，而朱慧敏亦抱起囝囝賞月，一家人的溫馨互動，羨煞旁人。</p>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏2023年10月底誕下女兒Shera。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4318dc12d875a4a63fb85f3f8fb2c3df/2024-06/queeniechu422_1698856642_3226565830605480688_1281054347.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏成功湊成「好」字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2961db69b39945879264e3cf43bd439/2025-02/chu_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏女兒樣子可愛，親手做母親節禮物送給媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8129cc2935f20a01b6c391fab30e74ee/2026-05/s1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"去年朱慧敏一家四口都有到維園賞月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e9b0187f5be53adb4955ed6e0197b58/2025-10/VS--1Instagram-0_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏是2004年港姐亞軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a97075e19c70122f21582fc6b0e9cefb/2023-09/DCENT50225082004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏為2004年度香港小姐競選亞軍兼「旅遊大使獎」得主。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4d7fb05f49251ec212b85cc27316ded7/2024-02/D70812082004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏2023年大女出世，成為人母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8084ee29f773611ef1d99fe64721e4da/2024-06/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_00_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏2023年10月底誕女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4318dc12d875a4a63fb85f3f8fb2c3df/2024-06/queeniechu422_1698856642_3226565830605480688_1281054347.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏產後親自為BB餵哺母乳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24237f5446cd1c0cea64382920333534/2023-11/QUENNE_MOV_snapshot_00_01_729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏B女半歲大的時候，身形變化很大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eacc9a9076c9686acd50feb6343f4cb5/2024-06/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_00_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏面對萌爆女兒都忍不住拍片及拍照紀錄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9601be5c42788479e9f7d344db09a80/2024-06/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_00_9_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>朱慧敏感性發文被子女純真感動</h2>\n<p>朱慧敏除了分享影片，亦在社交平台寫下長文，記錄連續第三年帶孩子到維園賞燈的心情。她憶述出發前曾問孩子們：「我們吃完晚飯去賞月，好嗎？今天是八月十五中秋節。」兩姐弟齊聲說好，大女更表示：「我想帶月餅和生果。」朱慧敏提議帶他們買燈籠時，大女笑著拒絕：「我自己有，唔使買啦。」原來她帶了在學校親手做的小白兔燈籠。到了維園，看到璀璨花燈，細仔Aten急不及待大喊：「Go go！」並指著花燈「嘩」了一聲，大女也跟著興奮大叫：「嘩！好靚！我鍾意。」朱慧敏看著一對仔女，感性地寫道：「看着他們，我常常被那雙純真發亮的眼睛感動。那一刻，我沒有想什麼大道理，只覺得世界很美，而他們正在慢慢長大。」字裡行間洋溢著作為媽媽的幸福感。</p>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏的囝囝與家姐好似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7370663d1ad56d6186d2f1e46b1083e5/2025-03/CHU_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏分享囡囡Shera與細佬互動的影片，深受網民歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/442b9c132dcde1f34d27f5437ef6d416/2025-04/VS--Instagram-0_03__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏細仔與家姐好似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/128377b366d049f3c723d1a3901f6914/2025-07/Q2_mp4_snapshot_02_15_990.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏早前在直播中與一對可愛子女同框。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebaf38356eaa2051c76ccaab61b0b91c/2026-02/1_11_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏抱著未夠一歲的細仔Aten開直播，Aten呆萌樣相當可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc062ff3c04d75189992c2e755f63b0b/2026-02/8_3_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細仔Aten今年2月會迎來一歲生日，朱慧敏表示將為子辦生日會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6c689b2ed6ec5f53cc80b5c18326544/2026-02/7_7_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩歲大女Shera活潑地加入鏡頭，與媽媽有問有答。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6e428cc77cc6edacda472c64999b12d/2026-02/6_5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Shera不時對著鏡頭揮手說「Hello」，非常有禮貌，盡顯良好家教。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/654f7c5eff0830654de318c165944350/2026-02/5_6_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏耐心聆聽女兒說話，母女間的互動充滿愛意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faa6a2c38c9f14f3081dfd975ccfd839/2026-02/4_11_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Shera更一度向媽媽要求聽兒歌，要求多多萌翻網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09095f95f7512fb47d0730cc1daae383/2026-02/3_6_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民紛紛留言，大讚朱慧敏是個有耐性的好媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fc22fe3a4f9ad1496cd94c1a8399a6b/2026-02/2_13_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏在IG分享與女兒的互動影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ed9ef953092bd2adb84b9b81454ec18/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"記錄了她與寶貝女兒在家一同製作曲奇餅的可愛過程。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2723c0f3d8b5a203b1735e095adbaa2/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏在IG寫道：「娃娃和媽媽在家造曲奇餅」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be10fee4bc8c5c5938835a9523e5c95a/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_03_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"影片中，她年幼的女兒化身「小廚神」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64ce628b7c6b72bea484ea91aa98523e/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有模有樣地參與每個步驟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f688b1c2a20f5092ab4b7b6f448dd08/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏女兒萌態百出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6748dc2a71a431933a7288ea86d50590/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏女兒引來網民大呼可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6b92e98d093703c3985cffa815ce1e6/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏的女兒雖然未夠兩歲，但對下廚充滿了好奇與熱情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26a97e9d8ee1d1909063c57f0c2b12f9/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"她與媽媽一起製作曲奇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/182c74060eae5d7c87bef0ff0a8d35ec/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"可見動作有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e0d6aeb654d6889361d7d7661549fcc/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小手在碗裡探索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/443b6b886a6366fe89fbf8d6ba866385/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一不小心就將麵粉灑得滿桌都是。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6f37b7320e813b817961ec8fda48bde/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甚至連頭髮及身軀都沾上了麵粉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a3c213135a313a4b89be52f319b8c6a/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"場面既搞笑又溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a86673eb6aac83d7fe0a2e94374e2ab/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BB腔發出「哇！」一聲，融化網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ac22abd4aa9c3b9d437ff9fea0176e2/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"可愛的模樣讓媽媽朱慧敏也忍不住甜笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4365747dfae1425c25a9b9ddbc288061/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民都笑指Shera被自己的「高超廚藝」嚇倒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93e1da13bcc32fdb0c1bd9463b288739/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏溫柔指導。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4cc138b54eaeeff2c49cdd9a05c15181/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小手非常可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/012b5bef7b9899dbb951444bbfd2f9ed/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"親手用模具成功壓出一個完整的曲奇形狀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0cddd5c50de7cf7c3643129fad06097e/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏大女好奇地看著手中的半製成品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b724da3552e8a94fa7113d68468f584/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-0_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"製成品大公開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa9528454a7dcdb002269a17f1e4009c/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"即刻想試食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1609d35ea7bc90dd699d6d0a2876e91/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏大女品嚐自己的手藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1dde84af1b6d20b9b3d492737bf9dfd/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"非常為食！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e51931fa9dce96bd16c0c6011efdc7c/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏大女看來很滿意自己造的曲奇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c18c21138219bb5df344c32f6c6c1c91/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_19_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱慧敏女兒吃得非常開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69f3b2be6a180b160c0eeee59661b6bb/2025-09/VS--QueenieChuqueeniechu422Instagramphotosandvideos-1_19_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T13:18:31.185311+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":722,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}